  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help the animals in Ukraine survive the winter!</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Happy Paw is a charitable foundation that has been supporting and taking care of animals in shelters throughout Ukraine for over 10 years.   And now, when the critical infrastructure of Ukraine is constantly under attacks because of the war, we must urgently buy firewood, heaters and stoves to give the shelters the opportunity to warm up and cook food for the animals. Otherwise, the animals will simply get extremely cold in winter!</narrative>
  </description>
